# Select the Rust egress (services/egress-rs) instead of the Bun one.
#
# The Bun egress stays the default: sproutboat-egress.service runs
# `bun node_modules/@sproutboat/wire/src/egress.ts`. To switch a host, install this file
# as /etc/systemd/system/sproutboat-egress.service.d/rust.conf, put the musl binary at
# /opt/sproutboat/bin/sproutboat-egress, then:
#
#   systemctl daemon-reload && systemctl restart sproutboat-egress
#
# To switch back: remove rust.conf, daemon-reload, restart. Same unit name, token file
# (/etc/sproutboat/egress.env), port 8070, sandboxing and MemoryMax; the edge unit and
# sbctl need no change. The Rust binary also listens on 8071 (the connect() tunnel),
# loopback only, like the Bun one from sproutboat-packages main.
[Service]
ExecStart=
ExecStart=/opt/sproutboat/bin/sproutboat-egress --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8070
